        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/90ced4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-28T08:38:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I prefer text-based cards, however some icons to identify START and END turn action will be useful.</p>\n<p>I’ve translated the game in italian, and put the card with it’s translation inside card sleeves.<br>\nIn the translated text, I’ve used a different color marker to identify some keywords like POWER (violet), START of the turn (green), END of the turn (red).</p>\n<p>It’s useful mainly for villain and environment cards.</p>",
