        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-10-22T13:02:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’d like the text to remain with the addition of a few icons that others have mentioned - specifically this is what I’d like to see:</p>\n<p>A damage type icon that could include the amount of damage or a question mark if it were variable and you needed to refer to the text.<br>\nAn immunity or resistance to damage type icon (it could be the previous icon with a shield around it). Use the infinity symbol for full immunity.<br>\nA start/end of turn icon.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
