      {
        "id": 22861,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-19T00:11:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There’s a reason why icons are popular in games (when they are done <span class=\"bbcode-b\">well</span>): They make the game easier to play and understand.</p>\n<p>I think it’s a good idea, Spiff. Arenson9 is also correct that the solution needs to be more than color-based, though, as there are a not-insignificant number of people who are color blind.</p>",
